"Permissions Pro%2$s og aktiver funktionen for filadgang."

#: classes/PublishPress/Permissions/UI/HintsItemExceptions.php:61
msgid "To customize editing permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature."
msgstr ""
"For at tilpasse redigeringstilladelser, aktiver funktionen "
"Redigeringstilladelser."

